  - key: FBL_DECO_TEXT
    value: '{0} BONUS SYMBOL AWARDS'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>BUCKS COMBO</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_1
    value: "<size=22>- Bucks symbols appear with values proportionate to the user's
      total bet.\n- Player is paid for all values that are part of Bucks symbol way
      wins (3 of a kind\n   or more from leftmost reel).\n- Values that are part of
      way wins are summed and multiplied by the number of \n   combinations.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_2
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>WILD</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_2
    value: '<size=20>- Wild symbols substitute for all symbols including Bucks symbols.

      - Wilds appear on reels 2, 3, 4, & 5 only

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>FEVER SPINS</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<size=21>- Fever spins are triggered randomly during Base Game. \n- During
      Fever Spins, the number of Bucks symbols on reels increase, and the values also\n
      \  increase up to 50x the user's total bet.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_2
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>BUCKS SYMBOL</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: "<size=20>- Bucks symbols have values proportionate to the user's total
      bet.\n- Bucks symbols can trigger the Party Bonus. \n- Each party member's value
      symbol will be collected towards the Bonus Meter, which is a group\n   bonus
      meter.\n- Party Bonus is triggered when the Bonus Meter is full.\n- 1% of the
      all values are also awarded towards the user's Bonus Bet. \n- This Bonus Bet
      is used for each player in the Party Bonus.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>PARTY BONUS</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: "<size=20>- Party Bonus is a community bonus game triggered and played
      collectively by 7 user's in \n   a single slot room.\n- Party Bonus lasts for
      7 free spins on a 1x1 single reel with one spot.\n- The reel can land on a Diamond
      value symbol, a Diamond +1 Spin symbol, or blank. \n- Each Diamond value that
      appears is summed and later added to the Bonus Bet amount carried \n   from
      base game.\n- For each +1 spin that appears, a free spin is awarded to all 7
      user's. \n- For each Diamond symbol that appears, all users contribute towards
      a group meter that \n  determines a bonus multiplier.  \n- Party Bonus ends
      when no free spins remain. \n- Accumulated Diamond values is summed with the
      initial Bonus Bet amount from base game,\n   then multiplied by the bonus multiplier.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Base Bet: 40</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff></size>243 WAYS</size>
